## 任务

sc.chapter_1.title=Prologue · The Seeker Reborn
sc.chapter_1.description=First steps into Stone Adventure — the very first chapter unfolds.

sc.quest.cobblestone.title=Stone Craft
sc.quest.cobblestone.body=The beginning and the end of the story.
sc.quest.stone_convert_table.title=Art of Conversion
sc.quest.stone_convert_table.body=Too much waste stone in your inventory? Use the Stone Convert Table to turn it into cobblestone.
sc.quest.stone_convert_table.body1=§oNewly awakened, you learn how to turn waste stone into cobblestone.§r
sc.quest.stone_armor.title=Stone Armor
sc.quest.stone_armor.body=Craft stone armor from cobblestone.
sc.quest.stone_armor.body1=Submittable items: Stone Helmet, Stone Chestplate, Stone Leggings, or Stone Boots.
sc.quest.stone_armor.body2=§oMend my stone armor, that we may march as one.§r
sc.quest.stone_hammer.title=Compressed Stone Hammer
sc.quest.stone_hammer.body=A new tool that combines the mining of a pickaxe and the damage of a sword... although it gets heavier as its level increases...
sc.quest.stone_hammer.body1=§oThe heavier the stone, the deeper the blow.§r
sc.quest.stone_nugget.title=Obtain Stone Nuggets
sc.quest.stone_nugget.body=A throwable trinket, obtained by smelting vanilla stone tools.
sc.quest.stone_nugget.body1=§oEven a stone chip, once thrown, can wound.§r
sc.quest.stone_coin.title=Stone Tongbao
sc.quest.stone_coin.body=Craft Stone Coins from stone and stone essence.
sc.quest.stone_coin.body1=§oStone Wandering Traders trade in the currency made from this very stone... perhaps it has been so since long ago.§r
sc.quest.stone_food.title=Stone Food
sc.quest.stone_food.body=Craft Stone Food from 8 cobblestone and one food item.
sc.quest.stone_food.body1=§oTake stone as your grain — wondrous results may follow.§r

sc.chapter_2.title=Chapter 1 · Chronicle of Recovered Memories
sc.chapter_2.description=We once heard stories buried deep beneath the earth; now at last we set out to seek them.

sc.quest.lv1_stone.title=Compressed Cobblestone Level 1
sc.quest.lv1_stone.body=This is where everything begins. On a crafting table, combine 9 cobblestone into Level 1 Compressed Cobblestone. Perhaps other stones will do as well.
sc.quest.lv1_stone.body1=§oPerhaps there are harder stones in this world.§r
sc.quest.lv1stone_pickaxe.title=Level 1 Compressed Stone Pickaxe
sc.quest.lv1stone_pickaxe.body=A little stronger than a stone pickaxe.
sc.quest.lv2_stone.title=Compressed Cobblestone Level 2
sc.quest.lv2_stone.body=On a crafting table, combine nine Level 1 Compressed Cobblestones into one Level 2 Compressed Cobblestone.
sc.quest.lv2_stone.body1=§oYou feel something calling out to you.§r
sc.quest.lv2stone_pickaxe.title=Level 2 Compressed Stone Pickaxe
sc.quest.lv2stone_pickaxe.body=A decent transitional tool.
sc.quest.lv3_stone.title=Compressed Cobblestone Level 3
sc.quest.lv3_stone.body=On a crafting table, combine nine Level 2 Compressed Cobblestones into one Level 3 Compressed Cobblestone.
sc.quest.lv3_stone.body1=§oA memory that never existed surfaces in your mind.§r
sc.quest.lv3_stone.body2=§oAll around is pitch black; a single candle lights a few swarthy faces. In its faint glow those faces seem to speak excitedly of something — then they sink into darkness.§r
sc.quest.lv3stone_pickaxe.title=Level 3 Compressed Stone Pickaxe
sc.quest.lv3stone_pickaxe.body=Truly serviceable.

sc.chapter_3.title=Chapter 2 · The Dark Slumber
sc.chapter_3.description=Dig open the gloom, and the truth of old begins to breathe.

sc.quest.head_debris.title=Head Debris
sc.quest.head_debris.body=Defeat the Elder Stone Guardian to obtain Head Debris.
sc.quest.head_debris.body1=§oCalamity — calamity drove the exiled warrior to leave his final relic in the Nether.§r
sc.quest.head_shard.title=Head Shard
sc.quest.head_shard.body=Craft Head Shards from Head Debris.
sc.quest.head_shard.body1=§oThe warriors gave everything. Even with their bodies turned to stone, their lifetime's fighting spirit never wavered.§r
sc.quest.stone_star.title=Stone Star
sc.quest.stone_star.body=Craft this precious item from Level 3 Compressed Cobblestone and a Nether Star at the Stone Crafting Table.
sc.quest.stone_star.body1=§oIt is the crystallized craft of our forebears. Countless souls sought it all their lives; countless gave their lives for it.§r
sc.quest.stone_crafting_table.title=Stone Crafting Table
sc.quest.stone_crafting_table.body=Craft from Level 3 Compressed Cobblestone, a Stone Star and a crafting table. The Stone Crafting Table can make more advanced items.
sc.quest.stone_crafting_table.body1=§oThe King said: "Having offered this craft of his own accord, it ought to be prized. Bestow ten thousand strings of coins to commend his merit."§r
sc.quest.lv4_stone.title=Compressed Cobblestone Level 4
sc.quest.lv4_stone.body=At the Stone Crafting Table, combine nine Level 3 Compressed Cobblestones into one Level 4 Compressed Cobblestone.
sc.quest.lv4_stone.body1=§oEven ancient civilizations struggled to reach such heights; only the technological outburst at the dynasty's end brought this stone into being.§r
sc.quest.lv5_stone.title=Compressed Cobblestone Level 5
sc.quest.lv5_stone.body=At the Stone Crafting Table, combine nine Level 4 Compressed Cobblestones into one Level 5 Compressed Cobblestone.
sc.quest.lv5_stone.body1=§oThe last glimpse of a vanished civilization now sees the light of day again.§r
sc.quest.lv5stone_sword.title=Level 5 Compressed Stone Sword
sc.quest.lv5stone_sword.body=Craft the Level 5 Compressed Stone Sword at a crafting table.
sc.quest.lv5stone_sword.body1=§oIn a sense, a replica of the King's own blade.§r
sc.quest.stone_hodgepodge.title=Stone Hodgepodge
sc.quest.stone_hodgepodge.body=Craft Stone Hodgepodge at the Stone Crafting Table.
sc.quest.stone_hodgepodge.body1=§oThe essence of every stone food, condensed into one.§r
sc.quest.lv5_stone_armor.title=Level 5 Compressed Stone Armor
sc.quest.lv5_stone_armor.body=Craft any piece of Level 5 Compressed Stone Armor.
sc.quest.lv5_stone_armor.body1=§oImpenetrable in every respect.§r

sc.chapter_4.title=Side Story · Antiquities Reclaimed from the Sands
sc.chapter_4.description=Dust and sand bury old relics; pick them up and learn their use.

sc.quest.raw_stone_essence.title=Raw Stone Essence
sc.quest.raw_stone_essence.body=Mine Stone Essence Ore to obtain Raw Stone Essence.
sc.quest.raw_stone_essence.body1=§oA strange gem buried deep underground — no alluring gleam, and riddled with impurities.§r
sc.quest.stone_essence.title=Stone Essence
sc.quest.stone_essence.body=Smelt Raw Stone Essence to obtain Stone Essence.
sc.quest.stone_essence.body1=§oThe essence of ten thousand years of stone, purged of impurities in searing heat.§r
sc.quest.stone_essence_crystal.title=Stone Essence Crystal
sc.quest.stone_essence_crystal.body=Craft Stone Essence Crystal at a crafting table.
sc.quest.stone_essence_crystal.body1=§oAll stone essence condenses into this single crystal soul; every impurity falls away.§r
sc.quest.stone_smithing_table.title=Stone Smithing Table
sc.quest.stone_smithing_table.body=Use the Stone Smithing Table to inlay essence beads onto your weapons and armor.
sc.quest.stone_smithing_table.body1=§oOnly this table can bear the work of inlaying essence.§r
sc.quest.inlaid_essence_bead.title=Inlaid Essence Bead
sc.quest.inlaid_essence_bead.body=Craft Inlaid Essence Beads at a crafting table, combine them with other items to grant attributes, and upgrade your tools at the Stone Smithing Table.
sc.quest.inlaid_essence_bead.body1=§oEndless recipes, endless possibilities.§r
sc.quest.expansion_slab.title=Expansion Slab
sc.quest.expansion_slab.body=At a steep cost, your tools gain more forging opportunities.
sc.quest.expansion_slab.body1=§oA steep price to break past the limit of slots.§r

sc.chapter_5.title=Chapter 3 · Truth Enters Play
sc.chapter_5.description=Having glimpsed the truth, you can no longer stand apart.

sc.quest.stone_heart.title=Stone Heart
sc.quest.stone_heart.body=Defeat the Spire Remnant to obtain a Stone Heart. Consume it to gain 4 points of Stone Heart health, which can absorb damage.
sc.quest.stone_heart.body1=§oThe shadow of calamity fell upon the spire. At last, the King understood — he was as foolish as his father. How could that towering and sturdy tower hold back the coming of doom? Like his father did back then, he raised his blade and paid for his sins with his life.§r
sc.quest.sacrificial_blade.title=Sacrificial Blade
sc.quest.sacrificial_blade.body=Find the Sacrificial Blade within the Ancient Stone Altar.
sc.quest.sacrificial_blade.body1=§o"This sacred vessel has proven its worth in your hands. Sacrius, ascend."§r
sc.quest.blood_bottle.title=Blood Bottle
sc.quest.blood_bottle.body=While holding a glass bottle, use the Sacrificial Blade to obtain a Blood Bottle.
sc.quest.blood_bottle.body1=§o"Behold, citizens! This is the sacred blood spoken of by Falsus Magus — flowing within such a lowly being!"§r
sc.quest.ersatz_blood_vial.title=Ersatz Blood Vial
sc.quest.ersatz_blood_vial.body=Craft an Ersatz Blood Vial from a Blood Bottle in a crafting table.
sc.quest.ersatz_blood_vial.body1=§o"Falsus Magus! You promised me! Then why is this blood impure?!"§r
sc.quest.blood_offering_vial.title=Blood Offering Vial
sc.quest.blood_offering_vial.body=Place the Ersatz Blood Vial in a brewing stand and purify it using a Stone Star.
sc.quest.blood_offering_vial.body1=§oNo one answered. Sacrius swayed in the wind, as destiny pointed toward a clear and terrifying path.§r
sc.quest.stone_summoner_activated.title=Activated Blood Sacrifice Pillar
sc.quest.stone_summoner_activated.body=Pour the Blood Offering Vial into the Blood Sacrifice Pillar at the center of the Ancient Stone Altar, then mine it.
sc.quest.stone_summoner_activated.body1=§o"Falsus Magus has deceived us! This is no herald of salvation — it is the prologue of calamity!"§r

## 生物志

sc.biogeography.title=Bestiary
sc.biogeography.description=Heaven and earth combine, all things are born; yin and yang connect, changes arise.
sc.quest.stoneguard.title=Stone Guard
sc.quest.stoneguard.body=§oHard exterior, silent danger§r
sc.quest.stoneguard.body1=Basic hostile mob that spawns in the Overworld, applies slowness on attack.
sc.quest.stone_shooter.title=Stone Archer
sc.quest.stone_shooter.body=§oThis guy is really annoying...§r
sc.quest.stone_shooter.body1=Basic hostile mob that spawns in the Overworld, shoots arrows and applies slowness.
sc.quest.elder_stone_guard.title=Elder Stone Guard
sc.quest.elder_stone_guard.body=§oI woke up, one-shot§r
sc.quest.elder_stone_guard.body1=Spawns in the Nether, wielding a sharp sword, punishing every player who enters the Nether without armor.
sc.quest.elder_stone_guard.body2=Just kidding, even iron armor gets one-shot.
sc.quest.stone_vendor.title=Stone Wandering Trader
sc.quest.stone_vendor.body=§oNot a scammer! We're saved!§r
sc.quest.stone_vendor.body1=Normally trades peacefully with players. But if you hit first, it will fight back.
sc.quest.stone_vendor.body2=What? You even have to kill him to complete the quest?!
sc.quest.stone_vagabond.title=Stone Vagabond
sc.quest.stone_vagabond.body=§oYou've awakened the Stone Vagabond§r
sc.quest.stone_vagabond.body1=Spawns only in Stone Wastelands. Tries to flee from players, but if provoked, shows its hidden side...
sc.quest.stone_fissuring_husk.title=Stone Fissuring Husk
sc.quest.stone_fissuring_husk.body=§oHow to defend against a zero-frame start?§r
sc.quest.stone_fissuring_husk.body1=A stone creature that spawns in Stone Wastelands. When damaged, it drops Stone Blocks, which will assist in attacking. Try getting close? BOOM!!!
sc.quest.sculk_statue.title=Sculk Statue
sc.quest.sculk_statue.body=§oA statue hidden in the Deep Dark, waiting for its prey to draw near§r
sc.quest.sculk_statue.body1=Sculk Statues spawn in the Deep Dark. They cannot attack on their own, but they summon Stone Golems when a player comes near.
sc.quest.stone_puppet.title=Stone Golem
sc.quest.stone_puppet.body=§oA mindless stone creation§r
sc.quest.stone_puppet.body1=Stone Golems are summoned into being, and each one summons a Stone Guard to fight alongside it.
sc.quest.stone_block.title=Stone Block
sc.quest.stone_block.body=§oSmall and cute, except for you and silverfish.§r
sc.quest.stone_block.body1=Maybe too much friction and not enough power? Stone Blocks will approach you in a stop-and-go manner and attack.
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_guard.title=Deepslate Stone Guard
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_guard.body=§oA mysterious threat from the deep§r
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_guard.body1=Tougher and more painful than Stone Guard.
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_shooter.title=Deepslate Stone Archer
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_shooter.body=§oEven dumber§r
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_shooter.body1=Tougher than Stone Archer, but not more painful.
sc.quest.molten_stone_guard.title=Molten Stone Guard
sc.quest.molten_stone_guard.body=§oBurned by fire, though fragile, it never gives up hunting its prey§r
sc.quest.molten_stone_guard.body1=Spawns in the Nether, or transforms from Stone Guard in fire/lava. Has lower health but higher speed and attack.
sc.quest.molten_stone_shooter.title=Molten Stone Archer
sc.quest.molten_stone_shooter.body=§oBurned by fire, though fragile, it never gives up hunting its prey (but this one is much squishier)§r
sc.quest.molten_stone_shooter.body1=Spawns in the Nether, or transforms from Stone Guard in fire/lava. Has lower health but higher speed.
sc.quest.molten_elder_stone_guard.title=Molten Elder Stone Guard
sc.quest.molten_elder_stone_guard.body=§oCan it get any more sinister?§r
sc.quest.molten_elder_stone_guard.body1=After being burned by fire, the Elder Stone Guard gains a more powerful "body". Only appears when an Elder Stone Guard is burned or enters lava.
sc.quest.mossy_stone_guard.title=Mossy Stone Guard
sc.quest.mossy_stone_guard.body=§oThe most poisonous spot§r
sc.quest.mossy_stone_guard.body1=A deadly variant that spawns in swamps, inflicts poison on players.
sc.quest.mossy_stone_shooter.title=Mossy Stone Archer
sc.quest.mossy_stone_shooter.body=§oDon't give me that swamp skeleton nonsense!§r
sc.quest.mossy_stone_shooter.body1=A deadly variant that spawns in swamps, inflicts poison on players.
sc.quest.sandstone_guard.title=Sandstone Guard
sc.quest.sandstone_guard.body=§oBeneath the yellow sand, it tells of a thousand years of resentment§r
sc.quest.sandstone_guard.body1=A Stone Guard that only appears in deserts, rumored to bring hunger.
sc.quest.sandstone_shooter.title=Sandstone Archer
sc.quest.sandstone_shooter.body=§oI looked, and behold a black horse.§r
sc.quest.sandstone_shooter.body1=A Stone Archer that only appears in deserts, rumored to bring hunger.
sc.quest.wandering_collector.title=Wandering Collector
sc.quest.wandering_collector.body=§oSurely you had a reason to kill him, right?§r
sc.quest.wandering_collector.body1=A collector that roams the land, rumored to have some connection to Wandering Traders — though no one knows why he doesn't have llamas. He has two trade tables. Those who trade with emeralds will fight back.
sc.quest.snatcher.title=Snatcher
sc.quest.snatcher.body=§oMercenary looters scattered across the world.§r
sc.quest.snatcher.body1=Snatchers spawn in Snatcher Camps. Though they belong to the Pillager faction, they may be treated as "outsiders" due to their low status. They attack with iron swords.
sc.quest.ancient_stone_totem.title=§o§l§p[boss]§rStone Totem§r
sc.quest.ancient_stone_totem.body=§oSource of ancient calamity§r
sc.quest.ancient_stone_totem.body1=A special and powerful boss, summoned by two Level 5 Compressed Stones and an Activated Blood Sacrifice Pillar.
sc.quest.ancient_stone_totem.body2=It has two states. State 1 can only be damaged by any pickaxe. State 2 will cycle through four forms. Be well prepared.
sc.quest.spire_remnant.title=§o§l§p[boss]§rSpire Remnant
sc.quest.spire_remnant.body=§oThe Lament of a Fallen Civilization§r
sc.quest.spire_remnant.body1=A mini-boss that spawns at spires. Defeat it to obtain a Stone Heart.
sc.quest.spire_remnant.body2=It has two phases. When its health drops below a certain threshold, it becomes enraged and gains increased movement speed.

